  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mi>x</mi></math> and <math><mi>y</mi></math> are the solutions of the equation&nbsp;<math><mn>12</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>21</mn></math>, then the value of <math><mn>12</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> is (Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>π</mi></math>)"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt><mo>,</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math><br />i.e. <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>13,13</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> i.e.<br />maximum value of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></math> is <math><mn>13</mn></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>13</mn></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>13</mn></math><br />Roots of the equation exist&nbsp;if <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>.</mo></math></p><p><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn></math> when <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>12</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>13</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>13</mn></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>13</mn></mrow></mfrac><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math> where <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>12</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p>"
